---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { recordedSteering as recorded } from '../showcases/steering/content';
---
<section class="recorded-steering wrap" id="recorded-correction" aria-labelledby="steering-title" data-recorded-steering>
  <header class="steering-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">A recorded correction</p><h2 id="steering-title">A new instruction.<br /><em>The same result.</em></h2></div><p>While a fictional file read was running, a correction changed the requested answer from a full sentence to the code alone. The read completed and the same stream returned <code>{recorded.answer}</code>.</p></header>
  <ol class="steering-moments" aria-label="The recorded correction and preserved result">
    <li class="steering-original"><p class="steering-step"><span>01</span> Original request</p><h3>Read, then write a sentence.</h3><p class="steering-label">Selected original instruction</p><blockquote>{recorded.original}</blockquote><p class="steering-caption">A real read of a fictional file, with a deliberate eight-second wait. No original sentence-format answer was produced.</p></li>
    <li class="steering-correction"><p class="steering-step"><span>02</span> {recorded.time('steer_queued')} · correction queued</p><h3>Change the answer format.</h3><p class="steering-label">Exact changed instruction</p><blockquote>{recorded.correction}</blockquote><p class="steering-running"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>One tool still running</p><p class="steering-caption">Queued while the read continued. Applied after its result arrived.</p></li>
    <li class="steering-preserved"><p class="steering-step"><span>03</span> Same code, revised answer</p><h3>Keep what the read found.</h3><div class="steering-values"><div data-steering-result><p>Tool returned · {recorded.time('tool_result')}</p><code>{recorded.result}</code></div><span class="steering-value-link" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-down" /></span><div data-steering-answer><p>Final answer · {recorded.time('done')}</p><code>{recorded.answer}</code></div></div><p class="steering-caption">One read · one correction · same stream.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="steering-disclosure">Recorded isolated execution · real model response · fictional file. The engine source was unchanged; a private allow-once hook and namespace restricted this test to the exact delayed read.</p>
  <div class="steering-inspection">
    <details data-steering-trace><summary>Inspect the recorded sequence <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div><p>Saved events from 15 October 2026. Times start at the original request; the eight-second wait was deliberate. This page displays the record and starts no service.</p><table><caption>Actual event order in the same stream</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Elapsed</th><th scope="col">Recorded event</th></tr></thead><tbody>{recorded.receipt.sequence.map(item => <tr><td>{item.seconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td>{item.label}<small><code>{item.event}</code></small></td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p>The delivery echo matched the queued correction and left no pending steer. It arrived before the single final SDK result; this run did not take the same-stream follow-up path.</p><p>Two model response sequences: one requested the read, the other gave the final answer. The correction used a separate SDK input/control write. One stream does not mean one model response.</p></div></details>
    <details data-steering-method><summary>Source and test boundaries <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div><p>Claude Engine {recorded.receipt.source.version}, commit <code>{recorded.receipt.source.commit.slice(0,7)}</code>. SDK {recorded.receipt.source.sdk}, CLI {recorded.receipt.source.cli}; actual model <code>{recorded.receipt.source.model}</code>.</p><p>Bash alone was exposed, but Bash is a broad grant. A private deny-by-default hook allowed this exact command once and replaced it with a fixed launcher. The read ran with read-only fixture access in a private filesystem and network namespace. The trusted CLI and launcher retained access outside that payload boundary.</p><p>No external plugins were configured. CLI metadata listed two built-in plugins and emitted a completed local Bash lifecycle event. No agent or Skill tool was called, and no background source remained at completion.</p><p>This verifies one corrected engine stream. PanelForge UI/database persistence, deployment availability, multiple corrections or tools, agent steering, voice behavior and universal model compliance were not tested.</p></div></details>
  </div>
  <a class="steering-receipt" href="/media/steering/receipt.json">Read the concise execution receipt <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a>
</section>
<style>
.recorded-steering{padding-block:42px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:24px}.steering-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:28px 64px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:28px}.steering-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.3vw,4rem);line-height:1.08}.steering-intro h2 em{color:var(--forest)}.steering-intro>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;max-width:470px;color:var(--muted)}.steering-intro>p code{font-size:.86em;color:var(--forest-dark);white-space:nowrap}.steering-moments{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.12fr 1.06fr;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border:1px solid #adb8a2;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;background:#fbfaf4}.steering-moments>li{min-width:0;padding:24px 24px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.steering-moments>li+li{border-left:1px solid #c1c9b7}.steering-correction{background:#edf0e4}.steering-preserved{background:#e5ecdb}.steering-step{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.6;color:var(--forest-dark);margin-bottom:18px}.steering-step>span{font:italic 21px/1 var(--serif);color:var(--rust)}.steering-moments h3{font:550 23px/1.25 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 22px}.steering-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px}.steering-moments blockquote{margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:450;padding:0;border:0}.steering-caption{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px}.steering-running{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;color:var(--forest-dark);margin-top:0}.steering-running>span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--forest);flex-shrink:0}.steering-values>div{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #b6c3a9}.steering-values>div p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:7px;color:var(--forest-dark)}.steering-values code{font:550 clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.7rem)/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:#263d29;white-space:nowrap}.steering-value-link{display:block;line-height:1;color:var(--forest);margin:1px 0 10px}.steering-value-link :global(.ui-icon){width:18px;height:18px}.steering-disclosure{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:18px 0 24px;max-width:970px}.steering-inspection{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.steering-inspection details{border-block:1px solid var(--line);align-self:start;min-width:0}.steering-inspection summary{min-height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;padding:12px 0;cursor:pointer}.steering-inspection summary :global(.ui-icon){width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}.steering-inspection details[open] summary :global(.ui-icon){transform:rotate(45deg)}.steering-inspection details>div{padding-bottom:18px}.steering-inspection details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.steering-inspection details code{font-size:.9em}.steering-inspection table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;margin:16px 0 20px}.steering-inspection caption{text-align:left;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:10px}.steering-inspection :is(th,td){text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:11px 8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.steering-inspection th{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:550}.steering-inspection td:first-child{white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;width:82px}.steering-inspection small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}.steering-receipt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;min-height:48px;margin-top:14px}.steering-receipt :global(.ui-icon){width:18px;height:18px}.recorded-steering :is(a,summary):focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:1000px){.steering-intro{gap:28px}.steering-moments>li{padding:22px 18px}.steering-moments h3{font-size:21px}.steering-moments blockquote{font-size:15px}.steering-step{font-size:11px;gap:7px}.steering-values code{font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.5vw,1.6rem)}}
@media(max-width:720px){.recorded-steering{padding-block:30px 36px}.steering-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.steering-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,8vw,3.2rem)}.steering-intro>p{font-size:16px;max-width:none}.steering-moments{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steering-moments>li{padding:22px}.steering-moments>li+li{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #c1c9b7}.steering-step{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:14px}.steering-moments h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px}.steering-moments blockquote{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:16px}.steering-caption{padding-top:14px}.steering-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.steering-values code{font-size:1.65rem;letter-spacing:-.045em}.steering-values>div{padding-block:12px}.steering-inspection{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.steering-disclosure{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}}
</style>
